{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30127","headline":"山中舒怀寄上丁学士 · 刘得仁","name":"山中舒怀寄上丁学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五字投精鉴，慙非大雅词。\n本求闲赐览，岂料便蒙知。\n幽拙欣殊幸，提携更不疑。\n弱苗须雨长，懒翼在风吹。\n砺镞端杨叶，光门待桂枝。\n计闻尘里誉，因和禁中诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}